<section class="rvfaq">
  <p class="rvfaq-eyebrow">Frequently Asked Questions</p>
  <h2 class="rvfaq-h2">Common questions we hear from customers</h2>
  <div class="rvfaq-grid">
    <details class="rvfaq-item"><summary>Will this Apple Pie gummy spike my morning glucose?</summary><div>It's sweetened with stevia and monk fruit on a pectin base — zero sugar, zero maltitol, zero sugar alcohols. The apple-pie is flavor, not sugar.</div></details>
    <details class="rvfaq-item"><summary>Why a gummy instead of a capsule?</summary><div>Because you chew it. A capsule is swallowed whole into stomach acid that destroys most of the active. Chewing starts the breakdown in your mouth — and it's gentle on a metformin-irritated stomach.</div></details>
    <details class="rvfaq-item"><summary>Is this real Ceylon or cheap Cassia?</summary><div>Made with true Ceylon — Cinnamomum verum — and third-party tested. Cassia can carry far more coumarin, a burden on the liver at meaningful doses.</div></details>
    <details class="rvfaq-item"><summary>Is 2,000mg enough? Other brands say 7,200mg.</summary><div>The number on the label isn't the number that reaches your cells. A capsule swallowed whole is mostly flushed. Chewed and pre-digested, 2,000mg of true Ceylon absorbs where digestion begins.</div></details>
    <details class="rvfaq-item"><summary>Is this one of those autoship traps?</summary><div>No hidden subscriptions and no surprise charges. Buy once, or subscribe to save and pause, skip, or cancel anytime — backed by a 90-day money-back guarantee.</div></details>
    <details class="rvfaq-item"><summary>How do I take it?</summary><div>Chew two gummies daily, ideally in the morning. Each bottle is a 30-day supply (60 gummies). Take it consistently — it's a daily antioxidant ritual, not a quick fix.</div></details>
    <details class="rvfaq-item"><summary>Is it third-party tested and made in the USA?</summary><div>Yes — manufactured in a GMP-certified facility in the USA and third-party tested for purity. Vegan, gluten-free, and non-GMO.</div></details>
    <details class="rvfaq-item"><summary>How fast is shipping?</summary><div>Standard shipping is typically 3–5 business days in the continental US. Orders of 3+ bottles ship free.</div></details>
  </div>
</section>
